# Check all enabled schedules once per minute. No approval or CRM writes.
# Run `pwd` in your checkout, then replace /absolute/path/to/project below.
# Install this entry only once, even when several schedules are enabled.
# Each saved schedule supplies its cadence, date bounds and IANA timezone.
* * * * * cd /absolute/path/to/project && /absolute/path/to/node/bin/npm run schedule:tick
# The command uses the running local server when available; otherwise it opens
# the private state database under the normal process lock and waits for its scan.
# Missed minutes are not backfilled. DST gaps skip; folds run once, at the first time.
